 &lt;a href="https://github.com/antoinebou12/ComfyUI-UML"&gt;antoinebou12/ComfyUI-UML&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;★ 3&lt;/strong&gt; · 3 forks · Repository created &lt;time datetime="2026-02-23"&gt;2026-02-23&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
